        "content": "\nThese already have real logic and no test coverage.\n\n**1a. `should_auto_apply` — `engine/agent/graph.py:40`** — the auto-apply gate, the single most important boundary condition in the whole system (severity ≤ 2 AND confidence ≥ 0.85, both required).\n\n```python\n",
