        "title": "engine/tests/agent/test_graph.py",
        "content": "import pytest\nfrom agent.graph import should_auto_apply, AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD, AUTO_APPLY_MAX_SEVERITY\n\ndef test_auto_applies_when_both_conditions_met():\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=0.9, severity=1) is True\n\ndef test_rejects_high_severity_even_with_perfect_confidence():\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=1.0, severity=3) is False\n\ndef test_rejects_low_confidence_even_at_lowest_severity():\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=0.5, severity=1) is False\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"confidence,expected\", [\n    (AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD, True),\n    (AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD - 0.001, False),\n])\ndef test_confidence_boundary_is_inclusive(confidence, expected):\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=confidence, severity=1) is expected\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"severity,expected\", [\n    (AUTO_APPLY_MAX_SEVERITY, True),\n    (AUTO_APPLY_MAX_SEVERITY + 1, False),\n])\ndef test_severity_boundary_is_inclusive(severity, expected):\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=1.0, severity=severity) is expected\n```\n\n**1b. `severity_for_orphan` — `engine/pipeline/detect.py:33`**\n\n```python\n",
