      {
        "title": "engine/tests/pipeline/test_detect.py",
        "content": "from pipeline.detect import severity_for_orphan\n\ndef test_orphan_with_children_is_severity_4():\n    assert severity_for_orphan(has_children=True) == 4\n\ndef test_orphan_without_children_is_severity_3():\n    assert severity_for_orphan(has_children=False) == 3\n```\n\n**1c. `rule_specificity` + `SurvivorshipRule` validator — `engine/pipeline/schema.py:101,108`** — governs \"most specific wins\" rule ordering, which is load-bearing for reproducibility.\n\n```python\n",
        "level": 1
